    "summary_one_sentence": "A rising pop sensation must navigate the relentless pressures of fame and the commercialization of underground culture as she prepares for her high-stakes arena tour debut.",
    "summary_short": "Rising pop sensation Maya is on the brink of superstardom as she prepares for her debut arena tour. As the music industry pressures her to conform, she struggles to stay true to the underground culture that inspired her original sound. Balancing intense rehearsal schedules with mounting psychological stress, she finds herself pushed to her limits. Ultimately, she must decide if mainstream success is worth losing her artistic identity.",
    "summary_long": "The film follows Maya, a fierce and talented artist who abruptly transitions from underground indie icon to mainstream pop sensation. As anticipation builds for her debut arena tour, the brutal reality of music industry exploitation begins to set in. Executives and handlers push her toward a sanitized, highly commercialized image that strips away the raw authenticity that made her famous. As dark secrets of the music industry surface, high-stakes psychological tension builds, turning her preparation into a desperate fight for survival and self-control. Amidst the chaos, a dark sense of humor highlights the absurdity of modern celebrity culture and the extreme lengths taken to package counterculture for mass consumption. Friendships from her underground days crumble under the weight of non-disclosure agreements and corporate interests. As opening night approaches, Maya is forced to confront both the internal demons born from her rapid rise and external threats to her creative vision. In a climactic showdown behind the scenes, she takes control of her narrative in an unexpected turn of events. Ultimately, the story serves as a sharp critique of fame, showing the personal sacrifices required when underground passion is sold to the highest bidder.",
